        "subject": "LU-19916 idl: placeholder for reserved connect flags",
        "message": "LU-19916 idl: placeholder for reserved connect flags\n\nPLACEHOLDER ONLY - DO NOT LAND.\n\nThis patch only carries the OBD_CONNECT2 flags reserved between\n0x200000000000ULL and 0x40000000000000ULL, so that the rest of this\nseries can build before those reservations land.  The real\nOBD_CONNECT2_MGS_TYPE reservation is in\nhttps://review.whamcloud.com/69529 (\"LU-19916 idl: reserve\nOBD_CONNECT2_MGS_TYPE flag\").  Once that has landed, this patch will\nbe dropped and the series rebased onto master.\n\nTest-Parameters: ignore\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5.5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I584491a3ae9d4e430cbe38e8dd791b836d81ac8d\n"
